{"overview":"در حالی که مردم عراق در دههٔ ۱۹۹۰ برای بقا می‌جنگند، لامیا دختر ۹ ساله برای تهیه کیکی به مناسبت تولد رئیس‌جمهور انتخاب می‌شود؛ در سرزمینی پر از ترس و کمبود، جایی که یافتن مواد اولیهٔ اساسی تقریباً غیرممکن است، لامیا با همراهی مادربزرگش، دوست وفادارش سعید و خروس خانگی‌اش هندی، سفری مصمم در شهر بزرگ برای پیدا کردن تخم‌مرغ، آرد و شکر آغاز می‌کند و در مسیر با فروشندگان و پلیس‌ها روبرو می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"While people across 1990’s Iraq struggle to survive, 9-year-old Lamia has been selected to prepare a cake to celebrate the President’s birthday. In a landscape of fear and scarcity, where basic ingredients are nearly impossible to find, Lamia sets out on a determined journey throughout the big city in search of eggs, flour, and sugar. Accompanied by her grandmother, her loyal friend Saeed, and her pet rooster Hindi, she navigates vendors and police officers along the way.","tagline_en":"","runtime":106,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Hasan Hadi"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Banin Ahmad Nayef","role":"Lamia","photo":"/db2ouYg8rZYr4vu406iGHkN0LsP.jpg","en":"Baneen Ahmed Nayyef"},{"name":"Sajad Mohamad Qasem","role":"Saeed","photo":""},{"name":"Waheed Thabet Khreibat","role":"Bibi","photo":""},{"name":"Rahim AlHaj","role":"Jasim","photo":""},{"name":"Muthanna Malaghi","role":"Muthanna","photo":""},{"name":"Ahmad Qasem Saywan","role":"Musa","photo":""},{"name":"Thaer Salem","role":"Majdi","photo":""},{"name":"Fatima Abouharoon","role":"Rahma","photo":""},{"name":"Mohammed Rheimeh","role":"Izzat","photo":""},{"name":"Rokia Alwadi","role":"Hiyam","photo":""},{"name":"Abdelkarim Jasim","role":"Malik","photo":""},{"name":"Maytham Mreidi","role":"Saeed's Father","photo":""}],"trailer":"8i3idbVnC6I","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1464883-the-president-s-cake/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard wi